  "description": "Project-independent Roslyn rules for C#: formatting, naming, documentation requirements, async hygiene and auth hygiene. AVIG0001-AVIG0023, seven with a code fix. The rules report as suggestions until you raise the severity yourself in .editorconfig; four of the eighteen are warnings out of the box.",
